{"segments": [
 {"id": "c06-title-01", "scene": "c06-title", "lang": "en", "text": "Chapter six. The order verb. Five forms.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["title"]},
 {"id": "c06-title-02", "scene": "c06-title", "lang": "en", "text": "You give an order to the person in front of you.", "pause": 0.25, "cues": ["sub"]},
 {"id": "c06-title-03", "scene": "c06-title", "lang": "en", "text": "So there are only five forms.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c06-table-01", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "en", "text": "To you, a man.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["row:0"]},
 {"id": "c06-table-02", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اُكْتُبْ", "pause": 0.45, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c06-table-03", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "en", "text": "Built on sukūn. The doer is hidden. It is you.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c06-table-04", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "أَنْتَ", "pause": 0.5, "cues": ["cell:0:3"]},
 {"id": "c06-table-05", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "en", "text": "To you, a woman.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["row:1"]},
 {"id": "c06-table-06", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اُكْتُبِي", "pause": 0.45, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c06-table-07", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "en", "text": "Built on dropping the noon. The ending is the doer.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c06-table-08", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "en", "text": "To you two.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["row:2"]},
 {"id": "c06-table-09", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اُكْتُبَا", "pause": 0.45, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c06-table-10", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "en", "text": "The same here. Built on dropping the noon.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c06-table-11", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "en", "text": "To you, men.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["row:3"]},
 {"id": "c06-table-12", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اُكْتُبُوا", "pause": 0.45, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c06-table-13", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "en", "text": "And again, dropping the noon. The ending is the doer.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c06-table-14", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "en", "text": "To you, women.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["row:4"]},
 {"id": "c06-table-15", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اُكْتُبْنَ", "pause": 0.45, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c06-table-16", "scene": "c06-table", "lang": "en", "text": "Built on sukūn. The ending is the doer.", "pause": 0.6, "cues": ["unhl"]},
 {"id": "c06-rule-01", "scene": "c06-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "So there are two ways to be built.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["show"]},
 {"id": "c06-rule-02", "scene": "c06-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "Two forms are built on sukūn.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["hl:are built on sukūn"]},
 {"id": "c06-rule-03", "scene": "c06-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "Three forms are built on dropping the noon.", "pause": 0.3, "cues": ["hl:are built on dropping the"]},
 {"id": "c06-rule-04", "scene": "c06-rule", "lang": "en", "text": "You will see where that noon comes from in Stage 8.", "pause": 0.7, "cues": ["hl:comes from in Stage 8"]},
 {"id": "c06-examples-01", "scene": "c06-examples", "lang": "en", "text": "Sit down, Aminah.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["ex:0"]},
 {"id": "c06-examples-02", "scene": "c06-examples", "lang": "ar", "text": "اِجْلِسِي يَا آمِنَةُ", "pause": 0.5, "cues": ["read:0"]},
 {"id": "c06-examples-03", "scene": "c06-examples", "lang": "en", "text": "The order is to one woman.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c06-examples-04", "scene": "c06-examples", "lang": "en", "text": "Go out of the classroom. This is to a group of men.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["ex:1"]},
 {"id": "c06-examples-05", "scene": "c06-examples", "lang": "ar", "text": "اُخْرُجُوا مِنَ الفَصْلِ", "pause": 0.7, "cues": ["read:1"]},
 {"id": "c07-title-01", "scene": "c07-title", "lang": "en", "text": "Chapter seven. Alif with damma, or alif with kasra? A list to learn.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["title"]},
 {"id": "c07-title-02", "scene": "c07-title", "lang": "en", "text": "The order verb starts with a helping alif.", "pause": 0.25, "cues": ["sub"]},
 {"id": "c07-title-03", "scene": "c07-title", "lang": "en", "text": "Look at the middle letter of the order verb.", "pause": 0.25, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c07-title-04", "scene": "c07-title", "lang": "en", "text": "If it has damma, start with alif and damma. If not, start with alif and kasra.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c07-table-01", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "en", "text": "In the first four, the middle letter has damma.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c07-table-02", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اُكْتُبْ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["row:0", "cell:0:2"]},
 {"id": "c07-table-03", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اُدْرُسْ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["row:1", "cell:1:2"]},
 {"id": "c07-table-04", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اُخْرُجْ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["row:2", "cell:2:2"]},
 {"id": "c07-table-05", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اُدْخُلْ", "pause": 0.45, "cues": ["row:3", "cell:3:2"]},
 {"id": "c07-table-06", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "en", "text": "So they start with alif and damma.", "pause": 0.5, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c07-table-07", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "en", "text": "In the next four, the middle letter has fatha or kasra. No damma.", "pause": 0.4, "cues": []},
 {"id": "c07-table-08", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اِذْهَبْ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["row:4", "cell:4:2"]},
 {"id": "c07-table-09", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اِجْلِسْ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["row:5", "cell:5:2"]},
 {"id": "c07-table-10", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اِفْتَحْ", "pause": 0.4, "cues": ["row:6", "cell:6:2"]},
 {"id": "c07-table-11", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "ar", "text": "اِشْرَبْ", "pause": 0.45, "cues": ["row:7", "cell:7:2"]},
 {"id": "c07-table-12", "scene": "c07-table", "lang": "en", "text": "So they start with alif and kasra.", "pause": 0.6, "cues": ["unhl"]},
 {"id": "c07-tip-01", "scene": "c07-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "The past verb does not tell you the middle vowel of the order verb.", "pause": 0.25, "cues": ["show"]},
 {"id": "c07-tip-02", "scene": "c07-tip", "lang": "en", "text": "So learn each order verb as a word.", "pause": 0.7, "cues": []}
]}
